.Dd 2026-10-15 19:30:00
.Dt QUERY-OPTIMIZATION 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm query-optimization
.Nd cara database pilih plan eksekusi paling murah
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Ini catatan Chapter 13 dari buku Database System Concepts.
Isinya: transformation of relational expressions, catalog
information, statistical information, cost-based optimization,
dynamic programming, materialized views.
.Pp
Bahasa santai. Tiap konsep dijelasin kenapa dia ada. Karena
optimization itu yang bikin database bisa milih plan yang bener
dari ribuan alternatif, dalam waktu milidetik.
.Ss Bagian 1: Kenapa Optimizer Perlu?
.Sy Masalah:
Satu query bisa dieksekusi dengan banyak cara. Contoh:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
pi_{name, title}(
    sigma_{dept_name="Music"}(
        instructor natural-join teaches natural-join course
    )
)
.Ed
.Sy Alternatif 1:
Join instructor dan teaches dulu, baru join course.
.Sy Alternatif 2:
Filter instructor dulu (dept_name="Music"), baru join.
.Sy Alternatif 3:
Filter teaches dulu (tahun tertentu), baru join.
.Pp
.Sy Cost difference bisa enormous.
Detik vs hari di beberapa kasus.
.Ss Bagian 1.1: Langkah Cost-Based Optimization
.Bl -enun -offset indent
.It
Generate logically equivalent expression pakai equivalence
rules.
.It
Annotate resultant expressions buat dapat alternative query
plans.
.It
Pilih plan paling murah berdasarkan estimated cost.
.El
.Ss Bagian 2: Equivalence Rules
.Sy Definisi:
Dua ekspresi relational algebra equivalent kalau generate
set of tuple yang sama di setiap legal database instance.
.Pp
.Sy Note:
Order of tuple nggak penting. Di SQL, input/output itu multiset
of tuple. Equivalent kalau generate multiset yang sama.
.Ss Bagian 2.1: Daftar Equivalence Rules
.Bl -tag -width "Rule 10" -offset indent
.It Sy Rule 1
Conjunctive selection bisa di-decompose jadi sequence of
individual selection.
.Bd -literal -offset indent
sigma_{theta1 and theta2}(E) = sigma_{theta1}(sigma_{theta2}(E))
.Ed
.It Sy Rule 2
Selection operations commutative.
.Bd -literal -offset indent
sigma_{theta1}(sigma_{theta2}(E)) = sigma_{theta2}(sigma_{theta1}(E))
.Ed
.It Sy Rule 3
Cuma last projection yang perlu.
.Bd -literal -offset indent
pi_{L1}(pi_{L2}(...(pi_{Ln}(E))...)) = pi_{L1}(E)
.Ed
.It Sy Rule 4
Selection bisa dikombinasi dengan Cartesian product dan theta join.
.It Sy Rule 5
Theta-join (dan natural join) commutative.
.Bd -literal -offset indent
E1 theta-join E2 = E2 theta-join E1
.Ed
.It Sy Rule 6a
Natural join associative.
.Bd -literal -offset indent
(E1 natural-join E2) natural-join E3
=
E1 natural-join (E2 natural-join E3)
.Ed
.It Sy Rule 6b
Theta join associative (dengan syarat tertentu).
.It Sy Rule 7a
Selection distributes over theta join kalau semua atribut di
theta_0 cuma involve atribut E1.
.Bd -literal -offset indent
sigma_{theta0}(E1 theta-join E2)
=
(sigma_{theta0}(E1)) theta-join E2
.Ed
.It Sy Rule 7b
Kalau theta_1 involve atribut E1 dan theta_2 involve atribut E2:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
sigma_{theta1 and theta2}(E1 theta-join E2)
=
(sigma_{theta1}(E1)) theta-join (sigma_{theta2}(E2))
.Ed
.It Sy Rule 8a
Projection distributes over theta join.
.Bd -literal -offset indent
pi_{L1 union L2}(E1 theta-join E2)
=
(pi_{L1}(E1)) theta-join (pi_{L2}(E2))
.Ed
.It Sy Rule 8b
Variant dengan L3 dan L4 buat atribut yang nggak muncul di
L1 union L2.
.It Sy Rule 9
Union dan intersection commutative. Set difference nggak.
.Bd -literal -offset indent
E1 union E2 = E2 union E1
E1 intersect E2 = E2 intersect E1
.Ed
.It Sy Rule 10
Union dan intersection associative.
.It Sy Rule 11
Selection distributes over union, intersection, set difference.
.Bd -literal -offset indent
sigma_theta(E1 - E2) = sigma_theta(E1) - sigma_theta(E2)
.Ed
.It Sy Rule 12
Projection distributes over union.
.Bd -literal -offset indent
pi_L(E1 union E2) = (pi_L(E1)) union (pi_L(E2))
.Ed
.El
.Ss Bagian 2.2: Pictorial Depiction
.Bd -literal -offset indent
Rule 5:        <>theta           <>theta
              /     \     ->    /     \
             E1     E2        E2     E1

Rule 6a:      <>                <>
             /  \              /  \
           <>    E3    ->    E1    <>
          /  \                    /  \
         E1  E2                  E2  E3

Rule 7a:     sigma_theta          <>theta
                |                /     \
               <>theta    ->  sigma_theta  E2
              /     \              |
             E1     E2            E1
.Ed
.Ss Bagian 3: Contoh Transformasi
.Sy Query:
Cari nama semua instructor di Music, dengan title course
yang mereka ajar.
.Bd -literal -offset indent
pi_{name, title}(
    sigma_{dept_name="Music"}(
        instructor natural-join
        (teaches natural-join pi_{course_id, title}(course))
    )
)
.Ed
.Sy Transformasi pakai Rule 7a:
Push selection down.
.Bd -literal -offset indent
pi_{name, title}(
    (sigma_{dept_name="Music"}(instructor))
    natural-join
    (teaches natural-join pi_{course_id, title}(course))
)
.Ed
.Sy Efek:
Performing selection as early as possible reduce size of
relation to be joined.
.Ss Bagian 3.1: Contoh Lain
.Sy Query:
Instructor Music yang ngajar course di 2009, dengan title
course.
.Bd -literal -offset indent
pi_{name, title}(
    sigma_{dept_name="Music" and year=2009}(
        instructor cross teaches cross pi_{course_id, title}(course)
    )
)
.Ed
.Sy Transformasi pakai join associativity (Rule 6a):
.Bd -literal -offset indent
pi_{name, title}(
    sigma_{dept_name="Music" and year=2009}(
        (instructor natural-join teaches)
        natural-join
        pi_{course_id, title}(course)
    )
)
.Ed
.Sy Lalu apply "perform selections early":
.Bd -literal -offset indent
sigma_{dept_name="Music"}(instructor)
sigma_{year=2009}(teaches)
.Ed
.Ss Bagian 3.2: Push Projection
.Sy Setelah selection di-push, push juga projection.
Contoh:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
pi_{name, title}(
    pi_{name, course_id}(
        sigma_{dept_name="Music"}(instructor)
        natural-join teaches
    )
    natural-join
    pi_{course_id, title}(course)
)
.Ed
.Sy Efek:
Reduce size of relation to be joined.
.Ss Bagian 3.3: Join Order
.Sy Rule:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
(r1 join r2) join r3 = r1 join (r2 join r3)
.Ed
.Sy Strategi:
Kalau
.Sy r2 join r3
gede dan
.Sy r1 join r2
kecil, pilih yang kecil dulu.
.Sy Contoh:
Compute
.Sy sigma Ns _{dept_name="Music"} Ns ( Ns instructor Ns ) natural-join teaches
dulu, baru join dengan course.
.Kenapa?
Cuma sedikit instructor dari Music. Jadi intermediate result
kecil.
.Ss Bagian 4: Cost Estimation
.Sy Kenapa perlu estimasi?
Optimizer harus pilih plan tanpa eksekusi query. Jadi harus
estimasi berapa cost-nya.
.Ss Bagian 4.1: Statistik Katalog
.Bl -tag -width "V(A,r)" -offset indent
.It Sy n_r
Number of tuple di relation r.
.It Sy b_r
Number of block containing tuple r.
.It Sy l_r
Size of tuple r.
.It Sy f_r
Blocking factor \(em jumlah tuple r yang fit di satu block.
.It Sy V(A,r)
Number of distinct values yang muncul di r buat attribute A.
.El
.Sy Rumus:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
b_r = ceil(n_r / f_r)
.Ed
.Ss Bagian 4.2: Histogram
.Sy Histogram
= distribusi nilai attribute.
.Bl -tag -width "Equi-depth" -offset indent
.It Sy Equi-width
Bagi range nilai jadi bucket dengan lebar sama.
.It Sy Equi-depth
Bagi jadi bucket dengan jumlah tuple sama.
.El
.Sy Contoh:
Histogram on age.
.Ss Bagian 4.3: Selection Size Estimation
.Bd -literal -offset indent
sigma_{A=v}(r)
n_r / V(A,r): number of records yang satisfy selection
Equality condition on key attribute: size = 1

sigma_{A<=v}(r)
c = 0 kalau v < min(A,r)
c = n_r * (v - min(A,r)) / (max(A,r) - min(A,r))
kalau histogram available, refine
kalau nggak ada info, c = n_r / 2
.Ed
.Ss Bagian 4.4: Selectivity
.Sy Selectivity
dari kondisi
.Sy theta i
= probability tuple di r satisfy
.Sy theta i .
.Pp
.Sy Kalau s_i
= jumlah satisfying tuple:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
Selectivity = s_i / n_r
.Ed
.Ss Bagian 4.5: Conjunction/Disjunction/Negation
.Sy Conjunction:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
sigma_{theta1 and theta2 and ... and thetan}(r)
n_r * (s1 * s2 * ... * sn) / (n_r^n)
.Ed
.Sy Disjunction:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
sigma_{theta1 or theta2 or ... or thetan}(r)
n_r * (1 - (1 - s1/n_r)*(1 - s2/n_r)*...*(1 - sn/n_r))
.Ed
.Sy Negation:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
sigma_{not theta}(r)
n_r - size(sigma_theta(r))
.Ed
.Ss Bagian 4.6: Join Size Estimation
.Sy Cartesian product:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
r cross s contains n_r * n_s tuple
Tiap tuple occupies s_r + s_s bytes
.Ed
.Sy Kalau R intersect S = empty:
r natural-join s = r cross s.
.Sy Kalau R intersect S = key for R:
Tuple s akan join dengan at most satu tuple r.
Jumlah tuple <= n_s.
.Sy Kalau R intersect S adalah foreign key di S referencing R:
Jumlah tuple = n_s.
.Ss Bagian 4.7: Join Size Tanpa Info Key
.Sy Kalau R intersect S = {A} bukan key:
.Sy Estimate 1:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
n_r * n_s / V(A,s)
.Ed
.Sy Estimate 2:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
n_r * n_s / V(A,r)
.Ed
.Sy Pilih yang lebih kecil.
.Ss Bagian 5: Cost-Based Optimization
.Ss Bagian 5.1: Join Order
.Sy Masalah:
Buat
.Bd -literal -offset indent
r1 natural-join r2 natural-join ... natural-join rn
.Ed
.Sy Ada berapa join order?
.Bd -literal -offset indent
(2*(n-1))! / (n-1)!
.Ed
.Sy Contoh:
n=7 -> 665,280. n=10 -> 176 miliar!
.Ss Bagian 5.2: Dynamic Programming
.Sy Ide:
Least-cost join order untuk subset tertentu di-compute sekali,
disimpan buat dipakai lagi.
.Sy Algoritma:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
findbestplan(S):
    kalau bestplan[S].cost != infinity, return
    kalau S contains only 1 relation:
        bestplan[S].plan dan cost berdasarkan best way of
        accessing S
    else:
        for each non-empty subset S1 of S such that S1 != S:
            P1 = findbestplan(S1)
            P2 = findbestplan(S - S1)
            A = best algorithm for joining results P1 dan P2
            cost = P1.cost + P2.cost + cost of A
            kalau cost < bestplan[S].cost:
                bestplan[S].cost = cost
                bestplan[S].plan = "..."
    return bestplan[S]
.Ed
.Ss Bagian 5.3: Left-Deep vs Bushy Join Trees
.Bl -tag -width "Bushy" -offset indent
.It Sy Left-deep
Right-hand-side input untuk setiap join adalah relation, bukan
hasil intermediate join.
.It Sy Bushy
Bisa join intermediate result dengan intermediate result.
.El
.Ss Bagian 5.4: Cost of Optimization
.Sy Bushy:
Time complexity O(3^n). Space O(2^n).
.Sy Left-deep:
Time complexity O(n * 2^n). Space O(2^n).
.Sy Contoh:
n=10 -> 59,000 (vs 176 miliar dengan enumerate semua).
.Ss Bagian 5.5: Interesting Sort Order
.Sy Masalah:
Cuma cari join order terbaik per subset nggak cukup. Harus
cari yang terbaik untuk setiap interesting sort order.
.Sy Kenapa?
Merge-join mungkin lebih mahal dari hash-join, tapi hasilnya
sorted. Ini berguna buat outer level aggregation atau join
selanjutnya.
.Sy Contoh:
Buat
.Sy (r1 join r2) join r3
dengan A sebagai common attribute:
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
Merge-join r1 dan r2 hasilnya sorted on A.
.It
Merge-join dengan r3 jadi lebih murah.
.It
Sort order juga berguna buat order by dan grouping.
.El
.Ss Bagian 5.6: Physical Equivalence Rules
.Sy Logical query plan -> physical query plan
dengan specify algorithm per operasi.
.Pp
.Sy Efficient optimizer depends on:
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
Space-efficient representation of expression.
.It
Efficient technique buat detect duplicate derivation.
.It
Dynamic programming based on memoization.
.It
Cost-based pruning.
.El
.Sy Pioneered by Volcano project.
Implemented in SQL Server optimizer.
.Ss Bagian 5.7: Heuristic Optimization
.Sy Kenapa?
Cost-based optimization mahal, bahkan dengan dynamic programming.
.Sy Heuristic rules:
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
Perform selection early (reduce tuple).
.It
Perform projection early (reduce attribute).
.It
Perform most restrictive selection dan join operations dulu.
.El
.Sy Sistem:
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
Ada yang cuma pakai heuristic.
.It
Ada yang kombinasi heuristic + partial cost-based.
.El
.Ss Bagian 5.8: Praktek
.Sy Banyak optimizer cuma consider left-deep join order.
Plus heuristic buat push selection dan projection down.
.Sy Oracle:
Repeatedly pick "best" relation to join next. Starting from
each of n starting points. Pick best.
.Ss Bagian 6: Materialized Views
.Sy Materialized view
= view yang content-nya di-compute dan disimpen.
.Sy Contoh:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
create view department_total_salary(dept_name, total_salary) as
select dept_name, sum(salary)
from instructor
group by dept_name
.Ed
.Sy Materializing:
Simpen hasilnya. Berguna kalau total salary per department
sering dibutuhkan.
.Ss Bagian 6.1: View Maintenance
.Sy Tugas:
Keep materialized view up-to-date dengan underlying data.
.Pp
.Sy Metode:
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
Recomputation on every update.
.It
Incremental view maintenance \(em pakai changes ke database
buat compute changes ke view.
.El
.Ss Bagian 6.2: Differential
.Sy i_r
= set of tuple inserted ke r.
.Sy d_r
= set of tuple deleted dari r.
.Pp
.Sy Update:
Replace update tuple dengan delete + insert.
.Ss Bagian 6.3: Maintenance Join
.Sy View v = r natural-join s.
.Sy Insert ke r:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
r_new natural-join s
= (r_old union i_r) natural-join s
= (r_old natural-join s) union (i_r natural-join s)
.Ed
.Sy Incremental change:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
v_new = v_old union (i_r natural-join s)
.Ed
.Sy Delete dari r:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
v_new = v_old - (d_r natural-join s)
.Ed
.Ss Bagian 6.4: Maintenance Selection
.Bd -literal -offset indent
v = sigma_theta(r)
v_new = v_old union sigma_theta(i_r)
v_new = v_old - sigma_theta(d_r)
.Ed
.Ss Bagian 6.5: Maintenance Projection
.Sy Masalah:
Kalau tuple (a,2) dan (a,3) di r di-project ke A, hasilnya
cuma satu tuple (a). Kalau delete (a,2), tuple (a) masih ada.
.Sy Solusi:
Keep count berapa kali tuple di-derive.
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
On insert, kalau tuple udah ada, increment count.
.It
On delete, decrement count. Kalau count 0, delete tuple.
.El
.Ss Bagian 6.6: Maintenance Aggregation
.Bl -tag -width "min, max" -offset indent
.It Sy count
On insert, increment count. On delete, decrement. Kalau 0,
delete group.
.It Sy sum
Maintain sum. Add/subtract B value. Maintain count buat
detect empty group.
.It Sy avg
Maintain sum dan count separately, divide at the end.
.It Sy min, max
On insert, straightforward. On delete, harus lihat tuple lain
di group yang sama buat cari new min/max.
.El
.Ss Bagian 6.7: Maintenance Set Operations
.Bl -tag -width "Intersection" -offset indent
.It Sy Union
Kalau insert tuple ke r, add ke v. Kalau delete, delete dari v.
.It Sy Intersection
Kalau insert tuple ke r, cek ada di s. Kalau iya, add ke v.
Kalau delete dari r, delete dari v kalau ada.
.It Sy Set difference
Similar logic.
.El
.Ss Bagian 6.8: Maintenance Expressions
.Sy Untuk ekspresi kompleks
.Bd -literal -offset indent
E1 natural-join E2
.Ed
.Sy Kalau insert D1 ke E1:
Insert ke E1 natural-join E2 = D1 natural-join E2.
.Sy Ini cuma cara biasa maintain join.
.Ss Bagian 6.9: Rewriting Queries
.Sy Materialized view v = r natural-join s.
User submit query
.Sy r natural-join s natural-join t .
Bisa rewrite jadi
.Sy v natural-join t .
.Pp
.Sy Tergantung cost estimates.
.Ss Bagian 6.10: View Selection
.Sy Pertanyaan:
View apa yang sebaiknya di-materialize?
.Sy Related:
Index selection \(em index apa yang sebaiknya dibuat?
.Sy Basis:
Typical system workload (query dan update).
.Sy Goal:
Minimize time to execute workload.
.Sy Tools:
Commercial database provide "tuning assistants" atau "wizards".
.Ss Bagian 7: Topik Tambahan
.Ss Bagian 7.1: Top-K Queries
.Bd -literal -offset indent
select * from r, s
where r.B = s.B
order by r.A ascending
limit 10
.Ed
.Sy Alternatif 1:
Indexed nested loops join dengan r sebagai outer.
.Sy Alternatif 2:
Estimate highest r.A value di result, tambah selection
.Sy r.A <= H
ke where clause.
.Ss Bagian 7.2: Halloween Problem
.Bd -literal -offset indent
update R set A = 5 * A where A > 10
.Ed
.Sy Masalah:
Kalau index on A dipakai buat temuin tuple dengan A > 10, dan
tuple di-update immediately, tuple yang sama bisa ketemu
( dan di-update) berkali-kali.
.Sy Solusi 1:
Always defer updates. Collect updates, update relation dan
index di second pass.
.Sy Solusi 2:
Defer only if required. Immediate update kalau update nggak
affect attribute di where clause.
.Ss Bagian 7.3: Join Minimization
.Bd -literal -offset indent
select r.A, r.B from r, s where r.B = s.B
.Ed
.Sy Check:
Kalau join dengan s redundant, drop.
.Sy Contoh kondisi:
Join condition on foreign key dari r ke s, r.B declared as
not null, no selection on s.
.Ss Bagian 7.4: Multiquery Optimization
.Sy Contoh:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
Q1: select * from (r natural join t) natural join s
Q2: select * from (r natural join u) natural join s
.Ed
.Sy Common subexpression:
.Sy r natural-join s
bisa di-compute sekali dan dipakai di kedua query.
.Pp
.Sy Tapi mungkin lebih mahal di beberapa situasi.
.Ss Bagian 7.5: Parametric Query Optimization
.Bd -literal -offset indent
select * from r natural join s where r.a < $1
.Ed
.Sy Masalah:
Nilai $1 nggak diketahui at compile time. Cuma tahu at run time.
.Sy Solusi 1:
Optimize at run time, tiap kali query submitted.
.Sy Solusi 2:
Parametric query optimization. Optimizer generate set of plan,
optimal buat nilai $1 berbeda.
.Sy Solusi 3:
Query plan caching. Kalau optimizer decide same plan optimal
buat all parameter value, cache dan reuse.
.Ss Bagian 7.6: Optimizer Upgrade
.Sy Masalah:
Kalau 95% plan lebih cepet di versi N+1, tapi 5% lebih
lambat. Gimana?
.Sy Jawab:
"Two wrongs can make a right. Fixing one wrong can make
things worse."
.Sy Approach:
.Bl -bullet -offset indent
.It
Allow hints untuk tuning query.
.It
Set optimization level, default ke versi N (Oracle).
.It
Save plan dari versi N, kasih ke versi N+1 (Sybase,
SQL Server).
.El
.Ss Ringkasan
.Bd -literal -offset indent
Konsep              Inti
Equivalence rule    Aturan transformasi ekspresi
Rule 1-4            Selection-related
Rule 5-6            Join commutative/associative
Rule 7-8            Selection/projection distributes
Rule 9-12           Set operations
Cost estimation     Estimasi cost tanpa eksekusi
Statistik katalog   n_r, b_r, l_r, f_r, V(A,r)
Histogram           Distribusi nilai attribute
Selectivity         Probability tuple satisfy kondisi
Join size estimate  Estimasi jumlah tuple hasil join
Dynamic programming Simpan best plan per subset
Left-deep tree      Join tree dengan relation di kanan
Bushy tree          Join tree bebas
Interesting order   Sort order yang berguna nanti
Heuristic optim     Perform selection early
Materialized view   View yang disimpen fisik
View maintenance    Keep view up-to-date
Incremental view    Compute changes, bukan recompute
Top-K               Limit results
Halloween problem   Update yang bikin tuple di-update 2x
Multiquery optim    Sharing antar query
Parametric optim    Plan untuk different parameter value
.Ed
Kalau kamu cuma inget satu hal dari catatan ini, inget ini:
.Sy optimizer itu nyari plan yang murah, tapi nggak bisa
enumerate semua kemungkinan. Dia pakai dynamic programming,
heuristic, dan cost estimation buat narrow down search space.
Hasilnya bukan selalu plan optimal, tapi cukup bagus dalam
waktu yang wajar.
.Pp
Yang belum dijawab di sini: gimana caranya ngukur akurasi
estimasi? Kapan heuristic lebih baik dari cost-based? Gimana
caranya handle query yang kompleks (nested subquery)? Itu
topik lanjutan: adaptive query optimization, machine learning
for query optimization. Kalau penasaran, cari sendiri.
